{"seq":2,"slug":"form-checkout-prefill-friction","title":"表单/注册/结算前置与少摩擦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/landing-performance-friction/form-checkout-prefill-friction","wordCount":2138,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"表单-注册-结算前置与少摩擦\">表单/注册/结算前置与少摩擦</h1><p>用户在落地页上愿意提供的信息量，与他在此刻对品牌的信任度成正比——而刚落地的那一刻，信任度是整条路径上最低的。这个不对称是表单摩擦的根本来源：每一个必填字段都是在信任尚未建立时索要的承诺。本篇讲三类摩擦的具体机制与削减手段：字段最小化、注册前置的代价、以及地址与支付的预填。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-字段最小化的判据\">核心概念：字段最小化的判据</h2><p>「减少字段能提升完成率」是共识，但缺少判据的删减会损害线索质量。可用的判据是：<strong>这个字段的取值，是否必须在此刻获得才能推进流程？</strong></p>\n<p>按这个判据把字段分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻塞字段</td>\n<td>缺了就无法完成本次交易（地址、支付、必填合规项）</td>\n<td>保留，放在靠后位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可延后字段</td>\n<td>可在转化后通过其他途径补齐（偏好、公司规模、来源）</td>\n<td>移到转化后或改为可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诊断字段</td>\n<td>只服务内部报表（渠道细分、兴趣标签）</td>\n<td>删除，改用埋点推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景下最常见的违规是把「市场/国家」做成了必填下拉框——如果落地页本身已经是 <code>/de/</code> 变体，国家信息已经由路径承载，再让用户选一次纯属摩擦，还容易与路径不一致。同理，货币与语言也应当由变体自动确定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"字段数量与完成率的关系\">字段数量与完成率的关系</h3><p>关于结算表单的平均字段数与放弃率，业界被引用最多的数据库是 Baymard Institute 的结算可用性研究；其公开页面对具体数值有访问限制，因此本篇不引用确切百分比，只保留结论方向：<strong>结算表单的字段数与放弃率正相关，其中地址与账号创建相关的字段是主要贡献者</strong>。团队应当以自己站点的实测基线为准，而不是套用外部数字——外部数字的品类与地区差异很大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注册前置的代价与访客结算\">注册前置的代价与访客结算</h2><p>强制注册是转化率损失最大的一类前置。逻辑很简单：注册的价值对商家是复购与留存，对用户是「多一道墙」；在尚未产生任何交易前索要账号，等于让用户为未来的收益支付当下的成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种模式对比\">三种模式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>完成率倾向</th>\n<th>复购倾向</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强制注册</td>\n<td>必须建账号才能下单</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高（有账号）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访客结算</td>\n<td>无需账号直接下单</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访客结算 + 事后建号</td>\n<td>下单后以邮件一步建号</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对跨境新客为主的落地页，访客结算是默认选择；对复购率高的品类，事后建号能兼顾两头。判断依据是<strong>首单转化率与新客占比</strong>，而不是行业惯例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实现要点\">实现要点</h3><p>访客结算的工程难点在于账号系统与订单系统的解耦：订单必须能在没有 <code>user_id</code> 的情况下创建，并支持后续认领（claim）。一个可落地的方式是把账号绑定推迟到支付完成之后，用一个一次性的 claim token 关联。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 订单以访客身份创建，user_id 可空，用 email 作为联系键&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;  id            BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_no      VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  user_id       BIGINT       NULL REFERENCES users(id),&#10;  guest_email   CITEXT       NULL,&#10;  market        VARCHAR(8)   NOT NULL,&#10;  currency      CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  status        VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;,&#10;  claim_token   UUID         NULL,&#10;  claim_expires TIMESTAMPTZ  NULL,&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT guest_or_user CHECK (user_id IS NOT NULL OR guest_email IS NOT NULL)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_claim ON orders (claim_token) WHERE claim_token IS NOT NULL;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_guest_email ON orders (lower(guest_email)) WHERE user_id IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单以访客身份创建，user_id 可空，用 email 作为联系键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_no      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  user_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guest_email   CITEXT       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_token   UUID         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_expires </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guest_or_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guest_email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_claim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders (claim_token) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claim_token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_guest_email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(guest_email)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>guest_or_user</code> 约束保证订单一定有一个可联系的主体；<code>claim_token</code> 上的部分索引让「用邮件里的链接认领订单」成为一次索引命中。这个结构同时支撑了事后建号：支付成功后发放 token，用户点击即建号并把历史访客订单挂到账号上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与归因的耦合\">与归因的耦合</h3><p>访客结算会削弱跨设备归因——没有账号作为稳定标识，跨设备合并只能依赖邮箱或支付指纹。这与第 4 章的归因链路直接相关，见 <a href=\"../postclick-attribution-cro/ad-landing-conversion-attribution\">投放-落地-转化漏斗归因</a>。因此 <code>guest_email</code> 的采集应当尽早且可靠（在支付前），而不是留到订单确认页。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预填与自动补全\">预填与自动补全</h2><p>预填是投入产出比最高的一类摩擦削减：它不改变字段数量，但把用户的输入动作变成确认动作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语义-autocomplete\">语义 autocomplete</h3><p>WCAG 2.2 的成功准则 1.3.5（Identify Input Purpose，AA 级）要求收集用户信息的输入字段，其用途可被程序化识别，HTML 中的实现方式是使用正确的 <code>autocomplete</code> token <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/identify-input-purpose.html\">WCAG 1.3.5</a>。这条准则的收益正是浏览器自动填充：字段带上正确 token 后，浏览器能一键填入姓名、邮箱、电话、生日、地址等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;form autocomplete=&quot;on&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; autocomplete=&quot;email&quot; required /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;fname&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;given-name&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;lname&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;family-name&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;tel&quot; type=&quot;tel&quot; autocomplete=&quot;tel&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;addr1&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;address-line1&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;addr2&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;address-line2&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;city&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;address-level2&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;zip&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;postal-code&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;country&quot; type=&quot;select&quot; autocomplete=&quot;country&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;ccnum&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;cc-number&quot; inputmode=&quot;numeric&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;ccexp&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; autocomplete=&quot;cc-exp&quot; inputmode=&quot;numeric&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/form&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">form</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fname\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"given-name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lname\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"family-name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span styl