style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ccnum\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cc-number\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inputmode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"numeric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ccexp\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cc-exp\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inputmode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"numeric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个易错点：一是字段名与 token 不一致（<code>autocomplete=&quot;name&quot;</code> 用在邮箱字段上，浏览器会填错）；二是把整个表单设为 <code>autocomplete=&quot;off&quot;</code>，这会一次性关掉所有预填；三是支付卡字段使用了 <code>inputmode</code> 之外的自定义输入框却丢掉 token，导致无法调用浏览器的卡号填充。</p>\n<h3 id=\"地址与地区差异\">地址与地区差异</h3><p>跨境地址补全的难点是<strong>地址模型因国家而异</strong>。德法等国的邮编与城市耦合度高、可用邮编反查城市；英国与荷兰依赖邮编定位；日本有都道府县层级；而部分新兴市场地址缺乏结构化数据，只能依赖自由文本。因此地址表单应当按市场切换布局，而不是全球一套字段。</p>\n<p>一个可用的市场地址配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;address_model&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;DE&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;street&quot;, &quot;house_number&quot;, &quot;postal_code&quot;, &quot;city&quot;],&#10;      &quot;postal_lookup&quot;: &quot;city_from_postal&quot;,&#10;      &quot;house_number_required&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;GB&quot;: { &quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;postal_code&quot;, &quot;address_line&quot;, &quot;city&quot;], &quot;postal_lookup&quot;: &quot;full_address_from_postal&quot; },&#10;    &quot;JP&quot;: { &quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;postal_code&quot;, &quot;prefecture&quot;, &quot;city&quot;, &quot;address_line&quot;], &quot;postal_lookup&quot;: &quot;region_from_postal&quot; },&#10;    &quot;BR&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;postal_code&quot;, &quot;street&quot;, &quot;number&quot;, &quot;complement&quot;, &quot;district&quot;, &quot;city&quot;, &quot;state&quot;],&#10;      &quot;postal_lookup&quot;: &quot;street_from_postal&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"address_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span>